          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:treatment#e-3ec5bf8e2adc1cd4",
          "text": "In some cases, it’s not so much the treatment of the animals on set in the studio that has activists worried; it’s the off-set training and living conditions that are raising concerns.",
